      "name": "Melvia",
      "normal_spell_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Commander",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "<p>During a conflict, you may use an action to perform a free attack with a weapon you have equipped, treating your High Roll (HR) as 0 when calculating damage.</p>\n<p>After the attack is resolved, choose one option: one ally who is able to hear you recovers 【5 +(SL &times; 5)】= <strong>35</strong> Hit Points; or you may immediately use a Skill you acquired among Bishop&rsquo;s Edict, Charging Cavalry or King&rsquo;s Castle for free (spending the appropriate MP).</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Queen's Gambit",
          "target": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Commander",
          "cost": "10",
          "description": "<p>During a conflict, you may use an action and spend 10 MP to choose one ally that can hear you.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That ally may immediately perform a free attack with a weapon they have<br>equipped (or with a basic attack if they are an NPC).</p>\n<p>They gain a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】= 3</strong><br>to the Accuracy Check, but treat their High Roll (HR) as 0 when calculating damage.</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Charging Cavalry",
          "target": ""
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Commander",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "<p>After you use Bishop&rsquo;s Edict, Charging Cavalry or King&rsquo;s Castle, you may choose another Player Character that can hear you who has yet to take a turn during this round.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That character may take their turn immediately after yours during this round.</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Crushing Chariot",
          "target": ""
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": true,
          "class": "Guardian",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Protect",
          "target": ""
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Spiritist",
          "cost": "5xT",
          "description": "<p>You strengthen and purify the soul energy coursing through your companions.</p>\n<p>Each target recovers from all status effects</p>",
          "duration": "Instantenous",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Cleanse",
          "target": "Up to three creatures"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Weaponmaster",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "<p>After an enemy hits or misses you with a melee attack, if the Result of their Accuracy Check was an even number, you may perform a free attack against that enemy (after their attack has been fully resolved).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This attack must be a melee attack and must have that enemy as its only target; treat your High Roll (HR) as 0 when calculating damage dealt by this attack.</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Counterattack",
          "target": ""
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Guardian",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "<p>When another creature is threatened by an attack, spell or other danger, you may take their place (any Checks that are part of the danger will be performed against you; you may declare the use of this Skill before or after the Checks have been made).</p>\n<p>If the danger already affected you, it affects you twice (resolve both instances separately); you also cannot protect multiple creatures from the same danger.</p>\n<p>If you use this Skill during a conflict, you cannot use it again until the start of your next turn.</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Protect",
          "target": ""
        },
        "7": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Spiritist",
          "cost": "10",
          "description": "<p>You imbue a weapon with the cleansing energy of your spirit. Until this spell ends, all damage dealt by the weapon becomes of the <strong>light</strong> type.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you have that weapon equipped while you cast this spell, you may perform a free attack with it as part of the same action.</p>\n<p>This spell can only be cast on a weapon equipped by a willing creature.</p>",
          "duration": "scene",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Soul Weapon",
          "target": "One equipped weapon"
        },
        "8": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Spiritist",
          "cost": "5xT",
          "description": "<p>You project your soul outside your body and direct it to surround the targets, shielding<br>them from dangerous magic. Until this spell ends, each target may treat their Magic<br>Defense as being equal to 12 against any effects that target it (they are still free to use<br>their normal Defense score if higher than 12).</p>",
          "duration": "scene",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Aura",
          "target": "Up to three creatures"
        }
      },
